OL,3,GNEWSAFans reflect on the ground they
OL,4,Alearned to call home
OL,5,
OL,6,F"There's memories that we've had inside
OL,7,Fthat ground that will stay with us all
OL,8,Ffor the rest of our lives," say
OL,9,Ffootball fans reflecting on 25 years at
OL,10,Fthe stadium they learned to call home.
OL,12,FSt Mary's Stadium, the home of
OL,13,FSouthampton Football Club, hosted its
OL,14,Ffirst competitive game on 25 August
OL,15,F2001.
OL,17,FNow, a quarter of a century on, those
OL,18,Fwho know the ground best have shared
OL,19,Ftheir memories.
OL,21,FSouthampton Football Club was first
OL,22,Ffounded at St Mary's Church in 1885.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
